<mxCell id="t11" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• CloudKit rules: no unique attributes, every property optional or defaulted, every relationship optional; additive schema changes only after release.&lt;br&gt;• Cascade: deleting a Player removes their PersonRounds; deleting a Round (All rounds swipe) removes its PersonRounds. A Round left with no PersonRounds after a player delete is removed by PlayerRepository.&lt;br&gt;• Handicap shown in the UI = Player.handicapIndex (manual) ?? HandicapCalculator(rounds) — the calculated value is never stored.&lt;br&gt;• Observation replaces v1 NotificationCenter refreshes (refreshListener / didImport); Import / Export is removed in v2.&lt;br&gt;• Every @Model change ships as a new VersionedSchema + migration test against a v1 fixture store." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="970" width="1740" height="120" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
